---
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
// Microbenchmark vs Macrobenchmark blind spots using Post 10's Todo service.
const W = 900;
const H = 304;
---
<figure class="gp17e">
  <div class="gp17e-scroll">
  <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Top: a microbenchmark tests encodeTodos alone inside go test -bench with one goroutine and no TCP sockets, reporting 26.8 µs/op. Bottom: a macrobenchmark fires concurrent k6 or vegeta traffic over HTTP into the full Todo service, exposing mutex contention, 95 GC cycles, span overhead (HeapInuse 3704 KiB vs live objects 1377 KiB), and a 6.9x jump from p50 131 µs to p99 898 µs.">
    {/* ---------- Row 1: Microbenchmark ---------- */}
    <text x="20" y="24" class="h">
      <tspan data-lang-en>1. Microbenchmark: fast feedback on one isolated Go function</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>1. Microbenchmark: phản hồi nhanh trên đúng một hàm Go cô lập</tspan>
    </text>

    <rect x="20" y="42" width="160" height="60" rx="8" class="box" />
    <text x="100" y="68" text-anchor="middle" class="b">go test -bench</text>
    <text x="100" y="88" text-anchor="middle" class="s">
      <tspan data-lang-en>single goroutine</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>một goroutine lẻ</tspan>
    </text>

    <line x1="180" x2="210" y1="72" y2="72" class="ln" />
    <polygon points="218,72 209,67 209,77" class="ah" />

    <rect x="220" y="42" width="232" height="60" rx="8" class="goldbox" />
    <text x="336" y="68" text-anchor="middle" class="b">encodeTodosEncoder(200)</text>
    <text x="336" y="88" text-anchor="middle" class="m num">26.8 µs/op · 10.7 KiB · 4 allocs</text>

    <rect x="470" y="42" width="410" height="60" rx="8" class="skip" />
    <text x="484" y="67" class="m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Missing: TCP sockets, store.mu lock contention,</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Bỏ sót: TCP socket, tranh chấp khóa store.mu,</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="484" y="88" class="m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>middleware chain, GC cycles under live heap, cgroups</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>middleware, nhịp GC khi heap phình, giới hạn cgroup</tspan>
    </text>

    <line x1="20" x2="880" y1="128" y2="128" class="rule" />

    {/* ---------- Row 2: Macrobenchmark ---------- */}
    <text x="20" y="156" class="h">
      <tspan data-lang-en>2. Macrobenchmark: full Todo HTTP service under realistic concurrent load</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>2. Macrobenchmark: toàn bộ Todo HTTP service dưới tải đồng thời thật</tspan>
    </text>

    {/* Load generator */}
    <rect x="20" y="176" width="146" height="94" rx="8" class="box" />
    <DiagramIcon name="network" x={93} y={198} size={22} />
    <text x="93" y="232" text-anchor="middle" class="b">k6 / vegeta</text>
    <text x="93" y="252" text-anchor="middle" class="s">
      <tspan data-lang-en>warmup + status check</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>warmup + check mã HTTP</tspan>
    </text>

    <line x1="166" x2="196" y1="223" y2="223" class="ln" />
    <polygon points="204,223 195,218 195,228" class="ah" />

    {/* Todo HTTP service container */}
    <rect x="206" y="170" width="460" height="114" rx="8" class="box" />
    <DiagramIcon name="server" x={230} y={190} size={20} />
    <text x="248" y="195" class="b">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Todo service (8 workers, 4,000 mixed requests)</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Todo service (8 luồng gọi, 4.000 request trộn)</tspan>
    </text>

    <rect x="222" y="210" width="136" height="58" rx="6" class="goldbox" />
    <text x="290" y="234" text-anchor="middle" class="b">routes() + JSON</text>
    <text x="290" y="254" text-anchor="middle" class="s">POST/GET mix</text>

    <line x1="358" x2="378" y1="239" y2="239" class="ln" />
    <polygon points="386,239 377,234 377,244" class="ah" />

    <rect x="388" y="210" width="130" height="58" rx="6" class="hot" />
    <text x="453" y="234" text-anchor="middle" class="r">store.mu lock</text>
    <text x="453" y="254" text-anchor="middle" class="s">
      <tspan data-lang-en>writer blocks readers</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>POST chặn GET</tspan>
    </text>

    <line x1="518" x2="538" y1="239" y2="239" class="ln" />
    <polygon points="546,239 537,234 537,244" class="ah" />

    <rect x="548" y="210" width="104" height="58" rx="6" class="hot" />
    <text x="600" y="234" text-anchor="middle" class="r">GC + spans</text>
    <text x="600" y="254" text-anchor="middle" class="s num">95 cycles</text>

    <line x1="666" x2="696" y1="223" y2="223" class="ln" />
    <polygon points="704,223 695,218 695,228" class="ah" />

    {/* Observed tail & memory box */}
    <rect x="706" y="170" width="174" height="114" rx="8" class="hot" />
    <text x="720" y="195" class="r">
      <tspan data-lang-en>What only macro sees</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Chỉ macro mới thấy</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="720" y="220" class="b num">p50 = 131 µs</text>
    <text x="720" y="242" class="r num">p99 = 898 µs (6.9x)</text>
    <text x="720" y="264" class="s num">HeapInuse 3,704 KiB</text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>A microbenchmark measures encodeTodos in isolation at 26.8 µs; running the whole Todo HTTP pipeline under 8 concurrent callers exposes mutex serialization, 95 GC cycles, and a 6.9x p50-to-p99 tail spread.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Microbenchmark đo lẻ hàm encodeTodos ra 26,8 µs; khi chạy trọn đường HTTP của Todo service dưới 8 luồng gọi đồng thời mới lộ tranh chấp mutex, 95 vòng GC và độ trễ đuôi p99 vọt gấp 6,9 lần p50.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .gp17e { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .gp17e-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .gp17e svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .gp17e text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .gp17e .h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gp17e .b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gp17e .m { font-size: 13.5px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .gp17e .s { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .gp17e .r { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--red); }
  .gp17e .num { font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .gp17e .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .gp17e .goldbox { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .gp17e .skip { fill: none; stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; stroke-dasharray: 4 3; }
  .gp17e .hot { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.3; }
  .gp17e .ln { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.5; fill: none; }
  .gp17e .ah { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .gp17e .rule { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; }
  .gp17e figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
